Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(job-offers): add endpoint to reopen a closed job
 offer

- PATCH companies/:companyId/job-offers/:jobOfferId/reopen, restricted to the company role.
- Only closed offers can be reopened; any other status answers 409 (HU6-13, HU6-27).
- Keeps every field of the offer and only switches its status to Publicada (HU6-10).

